# Google Maps Platform API Key
# Option A (Free Zero-Billing Prototyping):
#   1. Visit https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
#   2. Sign in with any Google account and accept the Maps Demo Project Terms.
#   3. Click Generate / Reveal Demo Key and paste it below.
#   Note: The Maps Demo Key has a daily quota limit and is for prototyping only.
#
# Option B (Production / Full Environmental Suite):
#   Create an API key in Google Cloud Console:
#   https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
#   Enable:
#     - Maps JavaScript API
#     - Places API (New)
#     - Geocoding API
#     - Weather API
#     - Air Quality API
#     - Pollen API
#     - Solar API
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
